  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FinancialResource">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A stock or supply of money.

Based on the Oxford Dictionary
&lt;a href=&quot;https://en.oxforddictionaries.com/definition/resource&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://en.oxforddictionaries.com/definition/resource&lt;/a&gt;

Syn. Funding Instrument

The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

CEF Programme
The Connecting Europe Facility (CEF) is a key EU funding instrument to promote growth, jobs and competitiveness through targeted infrastructure investment at European level. It supports the development of high performing, sustainable and efficiently interconnected trans-European networks in the fields of transport, energy and digital services. CEF investments fill the missing links in Europe's energy, transport and digital backbone.
&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/inea/en/connecting-europe-facility&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/inea/en/connecting-europe-facility&lt;/a&gt;</skos:definition>
