  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Specification">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Specification is  a document that states requirements. A specification can be related to activities (e.g. procedure document, process specification and test specification), or products  (e.g. product specification, performance specification and drawing). [ISO 9000:2005]

