  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ArchitecturePrinciple">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Architecture Principle ABB is a Principle defining the underlying general rules and guidelines for the use and deployment of all IT resources and assets across the enterprise. They reflect a level of consensus among the various elements of the enterprise, and form the basis for making future IT decisions.

Source: TOGAF 9.2 The Open Group (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap20.html#:~:text=Architecture%20Principles%20define%20the%20underlying,for%20making%20future%20IT%20decisions&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap20.html#:~:…&lt;/a&gt;)

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

The European Innovation Partnership on Smart Cities and Communities (EIP SCC) is a stakeholder driven initiative stimulated and supported by the European Commission. The EIP SCC has defined key priority areas which will be addressed including the architecture principle of Capabilities. Capabilities are the center element of the architectures to ensure that a common ground is
easy to be found.

Source: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/research/participants/documents/downloadPublic?documentIds=080166e5b9a18c76&amp;amp;appId=PPGMS&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/research/participants/documents/downloadPublic?doc…&lt;/a&gt;)</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">&lt;&lt;ELAP:Architecture Principle&gt;&gt; Privacy</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/EnterpriseArchitectureFrameworkAlignmentGuidelinesViewpoint"/>
    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of \u003C\u003CELAP:Architecture Principle\u003E\u003E Privacy&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Architecture Principle&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of \u003C\u003CELAP:Architecture Principle\u003E\u003E Security&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ArchitecturePrinciple_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ArchitecturePrinciple&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of \u003C\u003CELAP:Architecture Principle\u003E\u003E Privacy&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Architecture Principle&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of \u003C\u003CELAP:Architecture Principle\u003E\u003E Security&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-23&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitecturePrinciple&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/ArchitecturePrinciple&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Governance IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Privacy viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIRA Ontology viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Enterprise Architecture Framework alignment guidelines viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Security viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Architecture Principle ABB is a Principle that enables general rules and guidelines for the use and deployment of all IT resources and assets across the enterprise.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;\u003C\u003CELAP: Architecture Principle\u003E\u003E Security ABB is a Principle that refers to one of the prime principles found in any standard, and in any practice throughout the whole of IT. It encompassess the protection of valuable assets, by securing them safely within the boundaries of organizations, taking into account the ownership of the assets. This means that in any circumstance, one has to attend to the valuable property, being \u0027data\u0027 and \u0027technology\u0027 as a whole, both by securing access to (data)assets and by securing the proliferation of data(assets) outside the boundaries, for which one is responsible&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;TOGAF 9.2 The Open Group&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;ELAP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/pubs.opengroup.org\/architecture\/togaf9-doc\/arch\/chap20.html#:~:text=Architecture%20Principles%20define%20the%20underlying,for%20making%20future%20IT%20decisions&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/joinup.ec.europa.eu\/collection\/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\/solution\/elap\/distribution\/elap-catalogue-v120rdf&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The European Innovation Partnership on Smart Cities and Communities (EIP SCC) is a stakeholder driven initiative\tstimulated and supported by the European Commission. The EIP SCC has defined key priority areas which will be addressed including the architecture principle of Capabilities. Capabilities are the center element of the architectures to ensure that a common ground is easy to be found.(https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/research\/participants\/documents\/downloadPublic?documentIds=080166e5b9a18c76\u0026appId=PPGMS)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Architecture Principle ABB is salient for governance interoperability due to it lays the architectural framework to elaborate public services. Also, the Architecture Principle ABB is salient for organizational interoperability due to it establishes the requirements to sustain the business processes for enabling public services to exchange data.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:note&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The architecture Principle reflects the level of consensus among the various elements of the enterprise, and form the basis for making future IT decisions.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Legal view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Organisational view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Semantic view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TechnicalInfrastructureFunctionalContentGrouping">
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en"></skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Technical Infrastructure Functional content</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/HighlevelViewpoint"/>
        <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Technical Infrastructure Functional content&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TechnicalInfrastructureFunctionalContentGrouping_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TechnicalInfrastructureFunctionalContentGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Technical Infrastructure Functional content&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TechnicalInfrastructureFunctionalContentGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical Infrastructure Functional Content ABB is a Grouping of hardware, software, and network components that support the operation and functionality of an organization\u0027s IT systems and cloud services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/smarterwithgartner\/10-must-have-competencies-for-infrastructure-operations-leaders&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in Gartner&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Highlevel viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
        <skos:related>
          <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FacilityLocation">
            <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Facility Location ABB is a Location conceptual or physical place or position where a bussiness organization is placed.

Source: Inspired in Archimate

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/archimate3-doc/chap04.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/archimate3-doc/chap04.html&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: Facility Location ABB is salient for the organizational and technical interoperability because of (i) it determines the interlink between public administration business process removing existing barriers; (ii) set up needed mechanism between IT systems to remove fragmentation in service delivery.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FacilityLocation&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FacilityLocation&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FacilityLocation&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FacilityLocation&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:FacilityLocation

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</skos:definition>
            <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
            <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Facility Location</skos:prefLabel>
            <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Infrastructure"/>
            <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Facility Location&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/FacilityLocation_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/FacilityLocation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Facility Location&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/FacilityLocation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:FacilityLocation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Facility Location ABB is a Location conceptual or physical place or position where a bussiness organization is placed.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in Archimate&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/pubs.opengroup.org\/architecture\/archimate3-doc\/chap04.html&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Facility Location ABB is salient for the organizational and technical interoperability because of (i) it determines the interlink between public administration business process removing existing barriers; (ii) set up needed mechanism between IT systems to remove fragmentation in service delivery.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
            <skos:related>
              <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/CloudComputingFacility">
                <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Cloud Computing Facility ABB is a Facility that enables the storage, processing and use of data on remotely located devices accessed over the internet

Source: European Comission-Unleashing the Potential of Cloud Computing in Europe

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=COM:2012:0529:FIN:en:PDF&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=COM:2012:0529:FI…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): FENIX is an infrastructure research project that incorporates cloud computing facilities from ICT Solutions for Brilliant Minds. &lt;a href=&quot;https://fenix-ri.eu/about-fenix/project-partners&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://fenix-ri.eu/about-fenix/project-partners&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Cloud Computing Facility ABB is salient for organizational interoperability due to it provides the business rules and responsibilities to publish and manage the public administration services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/CloudComputingFacility&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/CloudComputingFacility&lt;/a&gt;

