                    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Saas&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SaasTechnologyService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SaasTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Saas&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/SaasTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:SaasTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-31&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;SaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures for delivering software that is owned and managed remotely by one or more providers. The provider delivers software based on one set of common code and data definitions that is consumed in a one-to-many model by all contracted customers at any time on a pay-for-use basis or as a subscription based on use metrics.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Gartner&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/en\/information-technology\/glossary\/software-as-a-service-saas&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Drupal is content management software. It\u0027s used to make many of the websites and applications you use every day. Drupal has great standard features, like easy content authoring, reliable performance, and excellent security. But what sets it apart is its flexibility; modularity is one of its core principles. Its tools help you build the versatile, structured content that dynamic web experiences need. https:\/\/www.drupal.org\/about&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The SaaS ABB is salient for organizational, semantic and technical and technical interoperability due to it provides the needed infrastructure to deliver public administration services on demand. Also, SaaS provides the functionalities of common data models and definitions to support the internal communication between software components. Finally, SaaS provides also the set up of business rules to ensure the correct performance of the software modules.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
                    <skos:related>
                      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService">
                        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: PaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures for delivering application infrastructure (middleware) capabilities as a service. There are multiple types of PaaS (xPaaS), including, among many more, application platform as a service (aPaaS), integration PaaS (iPaaS), API management PaaS (apimPaaS), function PaaS (fPaaS), business analytics PaaS (baPaaS), IoT PaaS and database PaaS (dbPaaS). PaaS capability can be delivered as provider-managed or self-managed, multitenant or dedicated.

Source: Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/platform-as-a-service-paas&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/platform-as-…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): OpenSHIFT is a secure and an enterprise-grade cloud-based container orchestration system with Kubernetes at the backend. It can be used both as a Red Hat Container Orchestration Engine and Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS). &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openshift/origin&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://github.com/openshift/origin&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The PaaS ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the mechanism to deploy and publish public administration services and make them accessible through the provided remote infrastructure.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PaaSTechnologyService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB521

ABB name: eira:PaaSTechnologyService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-31-01</skos:definition>
                        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
                        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PaaS</skos:prefLabel>
                        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Infrastructure"/>
                        <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of PaaS&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/PaaSTechnologyService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/PaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of PaaS&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/PaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:PaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-31&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;PaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures for delivering application infrastructure (middleware) capabilities as a service. There are multiple types of PaaS (xPaaS), including, among many more, application platform as a service (aPaaS), integration PaaS (iPaaS), API management PaaS (apimPaaS), function PaaS (fPaaS), business analytics PaaS (baPaaS), IoT PaaS and database PaaS (dbPaaS). PaaS capability can be delivered as provider-managed or self-managed, multitenant or dedicated.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Gartner&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/en\/information-technology\/glossary\/platform-as-a-service-paas&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): OpenSHIFT is a secure and an enterprise-grade cloud-based container orchestration system with Kubernetes at the backend. It can be used both as a Red Hat Container Orchestration Engine and Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS). https:\/\/github.com\/openshift\/origin&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The PaaS ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the mechanism to deploy and publish public administration services and make them accessible through the provided remote infrastructure.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
                        <skos:related>
                          <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/IaaSTechnologyService">
                            <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: IaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures to implement a standardized, highly automated offering in which computing resources owned by a service provider, complemented by storage and networking capabilities, are offered to customers on demand. Resources are scalable and elastic in near real-time and metered by use. Self-service interfaces, including an API and a graphical user interface (GUI), are exposed directly to customers. Resources may be single-tenant or multitenant and are hosted by the service provider or on-premises in a customer’s data centre.

Source: Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/infrastructure-as-a-service-iaas&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/infrastructu…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):  EBSI, the European Blockchain Service Infrastructure. lockchain Services Infrastructure (EBSI) aims to leverage the power of blockchain for the public good. EBSI is an initiative of the European Commission and the European Blockchain Partnership. what are databricks

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The IaaS ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the needed infrastructure to store information and virtualize software tools related to public administration.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/IaaSTechnologyService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/IaaSTechnologyService&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB522

ABB name: eira:IaaSTechnologyService

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

Last modification: 2022-31-01</skos:definition>
                            <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
                            <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">IaaS</skos:prefLabel>
                            <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Infrastructure"/>
                            <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of IaaS&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/IaaSTechnologyService_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/IaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of IaaS&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/IaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:IaaSTechnologyService&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-31&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;IaaS ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures to implement a standardized, highly automated offering in which computing resources owned by a service provider, complemented by storage and networking capabilities, are offered to customers on demand. Resources are scalable and elastic in near real-time and metered by use. Self-service interfaces, including an API and a graphical user interface (GUI), are exposed directly to customers. Resources may be single-tenant or multitenant and are hosted by the service provider or on-premises in a customer\u2019s data centre.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Gartner&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.gartner.com\/en\/information-technology\/glossary\/infrastructure-as-a-service-iaas&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):  EBSI, the European Blockchain Service Infrastructure. lockchain Services Infrastructure (EBSI) aims to leverage the power of blockchain for the public good. EBSI is an initiative of the European Commission and the European Blockchain Partnership. what are databricks&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The IaaS ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the needed infrastructure to store information and virtualize software tools related to public administration.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
                          </skos:Concept>
                        </skos:related>

                      </skos:Concept>
                    </skos:related>

                  </skos:Concept>
                </skos:related>

              </skos:Concept>
            </skos:related>

          </skos:Concept>
        </skos:related>

      </skos:Concept>
    </skos:related>

  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceOrientation">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Service orientation ABB is a Principle facilitating a way of thinking in terms of services and service-based development and the outcomes of services.

Source: Europa
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/isa_annex_ii_eif_en.pdf&lt;/a&gt;)

