  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SubsidiarityAndProportionality">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Subsidiarity and proportionality ABB is a Principle requiring EU decisions to be taken as closely as possible to the citizen

