:&quot;Inspired in referent consultancy companies and IEEE&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/roadmaps.ieee.org\/guide-to-technology-roadmaps&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Digital roadmap for organising mobility authorities (OMAs). (https:\/\/cerre.eu\/publications\/mobility-as-a-service-maas-digital-roadmap-public-transport-authorities\/)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Digitalization Roadmap ABB is salient for the governance, semantic and technical interoperability because it commonly offers (i) a transversal vision of existing reusable standards applied in the digitalization of the public sector, (ii) actions to ensure data exchange between digital services; (iii) technological software and assets that should be included in the digitalization of public administrations.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Governance IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Organisational view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Governance viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
