  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIManagerApplicationService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: API Manager Service ABB is a Application Service that that enables organizations to manage their Application Programming Interfaces (APIs) and create new APIs easily

Source: Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/api-management&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/api-manageme…&lt;/a&gt;

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIManagerApplicationService&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/APIManagerApplicationService&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:APIManagerApplicationService</skos:definition>
