n-technology\/glossary\/security&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Common Foreign and Security Policy (CFSP) - The Common Foreign and Security Policy (CFSP) is the organised, agreed foreign policy of the European Union (EU) for mainly security and defence diplomacy and actions. https:\/\/eeas.europa.eu\/topics\/common-foreign-security-policy-cfsp_en&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Security Policy ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it provides a guiding framework to ensure the security of data and information according to interoperability principles as stated in the EIF recommendation n\u00b0 46 and 47: \u0022Consider the specific security and privacy requirements and identify measures for the provision of each public service according to risk management plans.\u0022&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Governance IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Semantic view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Security viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Governance viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
