t;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Kibana at EU. https:\/\/big-data-test-infrastructure.ec.europa.eu\/service-offering\/kibana_en&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Block Storage ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it set up data storage and integration in fixed-sized blocks under a hierarchical infrastructure that permits ensuring their integrity through time.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
