ant database vendors&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Redis, The open source, in-memory data store used by millions of developers as a database, cache, streaming engine, and message broker. https:\/\/redis.io\/&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Database Cache Manager ABB is salient for semantic interoperability due to implementing a mechanism to manage data in memory to provide to the public administration consumers efficiently and in a short time response. It also facilitates data sharing and reuse using common data exchange models and serialisations.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
