vices to citizens and businesses by leveraging the power of digital technology.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired on the information available in Digital Public Services  in the Digital Economy and Society Index&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu\/en\/policies\/desi-digital-public-services&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The Spanish Tax Agency is responsible for providing Digital Public Services on TAX payment. https:\/\/sede.agenciatributaria.gob.es\/Sede\/en_gb\/iva.html&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Digital Public Service Provider ABB is salient for organizational and semantic interoperability because it offers (i) mechanisms to exchange information transparently; (ii) manage the information with needed security and trust; (iii) combine and harmonise information coming from multiple data stores to give service to the different agents (or stakeholders)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Organisational view&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Interoperability Privacy viewpoint&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Highlevel viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
