  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/DigitalSolutionAssumptionConstraint">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Interoperable Digital Solution Constraint ABB is a Constraint that refers to the factor that limits the realization of the exchange and sharing of data across different platforms

