  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EIRAViewRequirement">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: EIRA view ABB is a Requirement containing a graphical notation of the EIRA ontology. The EIRA consists of several architecture views (1) , including one view for each of the EIF interoperability levels. (1) An architecture view is a representation of a system from the perspective of a related set of concerns.

Source: TOGAF

Source reference: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag_03_17&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag…&lt;/a&gt;)

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Legal View - The Legal view models the most salient public policy development enablers and implementation instruments that shall be considered in order to support the End to End design of interoperable digital public services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EIRAViewRequirement&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EIRAViewRequirement&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB606

ABB name: eira:EIRAViewRequirement

Last modification: 2022-23-01</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EIRA View</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/EIRAOntologyViewpoint"/>
    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIRA View&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EIRAViewRequirement_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EIRAViewRequirement&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIRA View&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EIRAViewRequirement&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:EIRAViewRequirement&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-23&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIRA view ABB is a Requirement containing a graphical notation of the EIRA ontology. The EIRA consists of several architecture views (1) , including one view for each of the EIF interoperability levels. (1) An architecture view is a representation of a system from the perspective of a related set of concerns.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;TOGAF&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;(https:\/\/pubs.opengroup.org\/architecture\/togaf9-doc\/arch\/chap03.html#tag_03_17)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Legal View - The Legal view models the most salient public policy development enablers and implementation instruments that shall be considered in order to support the End to End design of interoperable digital public services.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIRA Ontology viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
    <skos:related>
      <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject">
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: EIF Interoperability Level ABB is a Business Object setting guidelines for developing public services. The EIF defines four interoperability levels, which cover legal, organisational, semantic and technical interoperability. Each level deserves special attention when a new European public service is established.

Source: European Commission, ISA Programme. The New European Interoperability Framework (EIF) for European public services. [Online] 2017

Source reference: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&lt;/a&gt;.)

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The EIF defines four interoperability levels, which cover legal, organisational, semantic and technical interoperability.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: ABB340

ABB name: eira:EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject

Last modification: 2022-23-01</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EIF Interoperability Level</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/viewpoint/EIRAOntologyViewpoint"/>
        <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIF Interoperability Level&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIF Interoperability Level&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2022-01-23&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIF Interoperability Level ABB is a Business Object setting guidelines for developing public services. The EIF defines four interoperability levels, which cover legal, organisational, semantic and technical interoperability. Each level deserves special attention when a new European public service is established.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;European Commission, ISA Programme. The New European Interoperability Framework (EIF) for European public services. [Online] 2017&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;(https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/isa2\/eif_en.)&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The EIF defines four interoperability levels, which cover legal, organisational, semantic and technical interoperability.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Governance IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:viewpoint&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;EIRA Ontology viewpoint&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
      </skos:Concept>
