  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SemanticGovernanceContentGrouping">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Semantic Governance Content ABB is a Grouping that refers to the concepts and terms to support the elaboration of rules and mechanims to enhance the availability, integrity, interoperability and  security of data while respecting data protection and ethical rules

Source: EUR-LEX

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:52020PC0767&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:52020PC07…&lt;/a&gt;

