  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TestEnablersGrouping">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Test Enablers ABB is a Grouping that refers to the applications and services that support the development and deployment of conformance testing and validation.

Source: Inspired in European Comision

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/testing-and-experimentation-facilities-tefs-questions-and-answers&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/faqs/testing-and-experimentati…&lt;/a&gt;

Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Interoperability Testbed - The Test Bed allows users to execute predefined test cases on their systems in order to test the conformance to standards and requirements, simulate a web-service, validate content and test a complete message exchange protocol. The Testbed manages test cases and users, and orchestrates domain-specific components, the domain-specific logic is in separate components that are used via web services. Test results are provided in a standardised, machine-readable format. The Test Bed also offers a test registry and repository (TRR) to store test artefacts (assertions, test cases, validation schemas, etc.) and compile test services (validation services, simulator services, etc.). Please visit the following website for more information: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/solutions/interoperability-test-bed_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/solutions/interoperability-test-bed_en&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Governance IoP, Behavioural IoP

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: The Test Enablers Grouping ABB is salient for interoperability because testing and validation solutions services are relevant aspects to ensure that they are conformant to relevant standards enabling interoperability.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TestEnablersGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TestEnablersGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TestEnablersGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TestEnablersGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:TestEnablersGrouping

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Test Enablers</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Application"/>
    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Test Enablers&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TestEnablersGrouping_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TestEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Test Enablers&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TestEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:TestEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Test Enablers ABB is a Grouping that refers to the applications and services that support the development and deployment of conformance testing and validation.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in European Comision&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu\/en\/faqs\/testing-and-experimentation-facilities-tefs-questions-and-answers&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Interoperability Testbed - The Test Bed allows users to execute predefined test cases on their systems in order to test the conformance to standards and requirements, simulate a web-service, validate content and test a complete message exchange protocol. The Testbed manages test cases and users, and orchestrates domain-specific components, the domain-specific logic is in separate components that are used via web services. Test results are provided in a standardised, machine-readable format. The Test Bed also offers a test registry and repository (TRR) to store test artefacts (assertions, test cases, validation schemas, etc.) and compile test services (validation services, simulator services, etc.). Please visit the following website for more information: https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/isa2\/solutions\/interoperability-test-bed_en&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Test Enablers Grouping ABB is salient for interoperability because testing and validation solutions services are relevant aspects to ensure that they are conformant to relevant standards enabling interoperability.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Governance IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ConformanceTestScenarioBusinessObject"/>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TransationEnablersGrouping">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Machine Translation Enablers ABB is a Groping that refers to tools or components that facilitate the translation of text from one language to another using machine learning techniques

Source: Inspired in eTranslation

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://commission.europa.eu/resources-partners/etranslation_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://commission.europa.eu/resources-partners/etranslation_en&lt;/a&gt;

IoP Dimension: Structural IoP, Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: The Translation Enablers Grouping ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it comprises a set of tools and components that ensure the translation of digital public services to different languages in the European Union by using machine learning techniques.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TransationEnablersGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TransationEnablersGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

eira:ID: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TransationEnablersGrouping&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/TransationEnablersGrouping&lt;/a&gt;

ABB name: eira:TransationEnablersGrouping

EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Translation Enablers</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/view/TechnicalView-Application"/>
    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Translation Enablers&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TransationEnablersGrouping_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TransationEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of Translation Enablers&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:PURI&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/TransationEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:TransationEnablersGrouping&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:definition&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Machine Translation Enablers ABB is a Groping that refers to tools or components that facilitate the translation of text from one language to another using machine learning techniques&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSource&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Inspired in eTranslation&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:definitionSourceReference&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/commission.europa.eu\/resources-partners\/etranslation_en&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Translation Enablers Grouping ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it comprises a set of tools and components that ensure the translation of digital public services to different languages in the European Union by using machine learning techniques.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - application&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
