-virtual-machine&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:example&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Redhat Virtualization: Built on Red Hat Enterprise Linux\u00ae and KVM and fully maintained by Red Hat, Red Hat\u00ae Virtualization is an enterprise virtualization platform that supports core virtualization workloads, including resource-intensive and important applications. With a solid foundation for a cloud-native and containerized future, virtualize your resources, workflows, and software applications. Additionally compatible with platforms like Microsoft Exchange and the Oracle database is Red Hat Enterprise Virtualization. https:\/\/www.redhat.com\/en\/technologies\/virtualization\/enterprise-virtualization&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopSaliency&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;The Virtual Machine ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides needed tools to emulate the public administration services under controlled environments.&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:concept&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Structural IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:iopDimension&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Behavioral IoP&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:view&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Technical view - infrastructure&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
