  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EiraView">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
EIRA view ABB is a Business Object containing a graphical notation of the EIRA ontology. The EIRA consists of several architecture views (1) , including one view for each of the EIF interoperability levels.

(1) An architecture view is a representation of a system from the perspective of a related set of concerns.

Source: TOGAF (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag_03_17&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://pubs.opengroup.org/architecture/togaf9-doc/arch/chap03.html#tag…&lt;/a&gt;)

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

Legal View
The Legal view models the most salient public policy development enablers and implementation instruments that shall be considered in order to support the End to End design of interoperable digital public services.</skos:definition>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EIRA View</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:broaderTransitive rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Deprecated"/>
    <ns0:properties rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">{&quot;namespaces&quot;:{&quot;rdf&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;rdf:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/1999\/02\/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;},&quot;skos&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;skos:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#&quot;},&quot;dct&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;dct:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/purl.org\/dc\/terms\/&quot;},&quot;owl&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;owl:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2002\/07\/owl#&quot;},&quot;eira&quot;:{&quot;namespace&quot;:&quot;eira:&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/&quot;}},&quot;rows&quot;:[{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;rdf:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2004\/02\/skos\/core#Concept&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:notation&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIRA View&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:identifier&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;http:\/\/data.europa.eu\/dr8\/EiraView_Properties&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;skos:prefLabel&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Properties of EIRA View&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;owl:deprecated&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;true&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:type&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;eira:EiraView&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;dct:modified&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;2023-05-25&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:ABB_Status&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;Obsolete&quot;},{&quot;property&quot;:&quot;eira:ID&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;ABB336&quot;}]}</ns0:properties>
