  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/IntegratedHorizontalUserExperience">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Integrated horizontal user experience ABB is a Principle refering to a user's experience, when her/his experience using a digital interface is fluent and seamless, also when she/he navigates through different applications/contexts.

Source: Economicshelp
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.economicshelp.org/blog/glossary/horizontal-integration/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.economicshelp.org/blog/glossary/horizontal-integration/&lt;/a&gt;)

EXAMPLES:
The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):</skos:definition>
